{"articleNo":"192003","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=192003&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 2018 Fall Semester Korean Language Program Admission Guideline","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.05.02","hit":"3415","attachments":[{"name":"2018년 가을학기 외국인 한국어과정 모집안(국문).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=192003&attachNo=79169"},{"name":"2018-Fall Korean Language Course Guide(Eng).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=192003&attachNo=79211"},{"name":"[Form] Application form.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=192003&attachNo=79248"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt\">2018 Fall&nbsp;Semester<span style=\"COLOR: rgb(239,0,124)\"> Korean Language&nbsp;Program </span>Admission Guideline </span></b><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt\">For International Students</span></b></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt\">2018 가을학기 금오공과대학교 한국어연수과정 모집 안내<br></span></b></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\">We are pleased to inform you of 2018 kit&nbsp;Fall Semester Korean Language Program Admission Guideline for International student.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">Please see attached for further information and if there are any students interested in&nbsp;Korean Language Program, please send me original documents&nbsp;on time.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">2018 금오공과대학교 한국어연수과정 모집요강 안내합니다. </span></span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">첨부된 파일을 참고하기 바라며 한국어연수과정에 관심있는&nbsp;분은 입학관련 서류를 원본으로 준비하여 우편으로 보내주시기 바랍니다. &nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">All required documents must be written by computer typing and send us one original document by post only.</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><font color=\"#666666\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">모든 서류는 컴퓨터 타이핑 되어야 하며 원본 서류만 유효합니다.</span></font><br></span></p></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Submission Deadline</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"> (제출 마감기한)</span></span></b></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, &quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">&nbsp;- 1st acceptance: 8.May.2018. ~ 23. May. 2018</span></b></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><strong><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"4\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;2nd acceptance: 1.June.2018. ~ 18. June. 2018</font></strong></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-a